name iso-639-3
# ISO 639-3's code table: every row says of its identifier what each column holds, under the column's own name, as the
# header spells it. The Comment column is the editors' note on the row, read by nothing.
match iso-639-3.tab
grammar table
header
# The tables do not name who publishes them; the pages kept beside them in sil/ are signed "Copyright © 2026 SIL Global".
witness SIL Global

claims
subject in Id
attest Part2b Part2t Part1 Scope Language_Type Ref_Name
